An on-site assistant that answers only from this site's own content, and
config so Claude Code, Copilot, and Gemini contribute under the same rules.

Assistant
- lib/assistant/knowledge.ts: retrievable corpus built from data/ — answers,
  services, all 84 service x city bands, methods, guides, glossary, cities,
  species, OBC thresholds, company facts. Server-only, so ~90 KB of corpus
  stays out of the client bundle.
- lib/assistant/respond.ts: intent routing with hard guarantees — a price
  question naming a city returns that city's computed band; a code question
  quotes OBC_LIMITS and defers to the building department; an unknown question
  says so and hands over the phone number.
- app/api/ask: grounded by default. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY adds a phrasing layer
  over the same retrieved passages, with fallback to the grounded reply on any
  error. Citations always come from retrieval, never from the model.
- components/assistant: the widget, sitting above the mobile CTA bar so it
  never covers the phone number.
- fix: 'carpet to hardwood stairs' was classified out-of-scope because it
  contains the word carpet, answering the flagship query with a refusal.

Agent configs
- AGENTS.md as the single source; CLAUDE.md, .github/copilot-instructions.md,
  GEMINI.md, .gemini/styleguide.md point at it.

94 tests. 181 pages, 181 unique titles, clean audit.
